node_modules/@flue/cli/docs/reference/streaming-protocol.md-316-Returns stream metadata as headers with no body: `Content-Type: application/json`, `Cache-Control: no-store`, `Stream-Next-Offset` (the current durable head), `Stream-Up-To-Date: true`. A missing stream returns `404` with error headers and no body.
